- crates/shadewire-mtlx/src/elaborate/hextile.rs: lowering of libraries/stdlib/genglsl/mx_hextiledimage.glsl
- crates/shadewire-mtlx/src/elaborate/ramp.rs: lowering of libraries/stdlib/genglsl/mx_ramplr_*.glsl and
  mx_ramptb_*.glsl

